{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_java_pages_phase_11_testing_06_mockmvc_04c_multipart_and_request_postprocessors", "label": "04c-multipart-and-request-postprocessors.md", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "page", "source_file": "docs/java/pages/phase-11-testing/06-mockmvc/04c-multipart-and-request-postprocessors.md", "source_location": "L1", "frontmatter": {"title": "MockMvc constructs a MockMultipartHttpServletRequest directly, so a multipart test parses no boundaries and enforces no size limit \u2014 and the convenient file(name, bytes) overload builds a part whose original filename is the empty string and whose content type is null, which is enough to make a filename-validation test pass for the wrong reason", "sidebar_label": "04c \u00b7 Multipart and post-processors", "sidebar_position": "11"}, "_origin": "ast"}, {"id": "docs_java_pages_phase_11_testing_06_mockmvc_04c_multipart_and_request_postprocessors_multipart_nothing_is_parsed_and_the_filename_is_empty", "label": "\ud83d\udd34 Multipart: nothing is parsed, and the filename is empty", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "docs/java/pages/phase-11-testing/06-mockmvc/04c-multipart-and-request-postprocessors.md", "source_location": "L26", "_origin": "ast"}, {"id": "docs_java_pages_phase_11_testing_06_mockmvc_04c_multipart_and_request_postprocessors_with_requestpostprocessor_the_extension_point_everything_else_plugs_into", "label": "`with(RequestPostProcessor)` \u2014 the extension point everything else plugs into", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "docs/java/pages/phase-11-testing/06-mockmvc/04c-multipart-and-request-postprocessors.md", "source_location": "L79", "_origin": "ast"}, {"id": "docs_java_pages_phase_11_testing_06_mockmvc_04c_multipart_and_request_postprocessors_gotchas", "label": "Gotchas", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "docs/java/pages/phase-11-testing/06-mockmvc/04c-multipart-and-request-postprocessors.md", "sou